# Store submission

When the conversation is about shipping, listing, screenshots, review, TestFlight, Play Console, or store rejection errors, **read the matching guide before answering or changing code**:

| Topic | Doc |
| --- | --- |
| **iOS / iPhone / App Store Connect / TestFlight / Apple review** | [`docs/APP_STORE.md`](docs/APP_STORE.md) |
| **Android / Google Play / Play Console / AAB / internal testing** | [`docs/GOOGLE_PLAY.md`](docs/GOOGLE_PLAY.md) |

## Hard rules agents must remember

1. **App Store Connect accepts PNG** (and JPEG). A failed screenshot upload is almost always **wrong pixel dimensions**, not the file extension. Quote the sizes from `docs/APP_STORE.md` — do not invent “convert to JPG” as the fix.
2. Play feature graphics in `assets/store/` are **Play-only** (1024 × 500). They are not App Store screenshots.
3. Do not invent Apple/Google account steps the human must do (payment, enrollment, Console clicks) as if the agent completed them. Point at the checklist in the doc.
4. Keep health wording aligned with both guides: exercise companion, not diagnose / treat / medical device.
